  abstract: >
  GODAS Regional Data Tool is a Windows-oriented Python desktop application
  for downloading, quality control, standardization, scientific analysis,
  and spatial visualization of NOAA Global Ocean Data Assimilation System
  (GODAS) data for user-defined marine study regions.
